WEBVTT

00:02:37.930 --> 00:02:43.890
The dark parts hunters, King and Queen,
attacked Kane's team outside the stadium.

00:02:43.890 --> 00:02:47.460
And then defeated
Yusuf and Mariam.

00:02:48.850 --> 00:02:53.020
Takao and Max will be the next
to fight these fearsome foes.

00:02:53.490 --> 00:02:57.460
Kai and Rei will have a tough
fight ahead of them, too.

00:02:57.460 --> 00:03:00.560
The final rounds are
really heating up!

00:03:16.450 --> 00:03:19.570
Final rounds of the
world championships!

00:03:19.570 --> 00:03:23.000
Is this the last battle
of the first round?

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:27.560
Kai Hiwatari/Rei Kon team VS the Central
American reps, the Sanchez brothers!

00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:32.580
Rei has defeated Sanchez
and gained one point!

00:03:32.580 --> 00:03:38.250
If Kai wins this battle, his
team's going to the semi-finals!

00:03:38.250 --> 00:03:42.850
I can't get a lock on the
Sanchez brothers' patterns.

00:03:42.850 --> 00:03:45.700
Kai! Don't let him
control the pace!

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:47.000
Fight in your own style!

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:49.140
¡Hola, Hola!

00:03:49.140 --> 00:03:52.450
You should attack a
little harder, amigo!

00:03:53.130 --> 00:03:56.540
Calm down, Kai!
This is a part of their plan!

00:03:56.540 --> 00:04:00.510
What's wrong? If you
won't attack, I will!

00:04:01.730 --> 00:04:03.660
I can't even focus!

00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:07.100
Kai! Stop messing around
and wrap this up!

00:04:07.100 --> 00:04:12.140
They're pretty strong,
having made it this far!

00:04:14.290 --> 00:04:16.890
Let's get
this over with!

00:04:16.890 --> 00:04:18.480
Dranzer!

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:22.780
--What?!

00:04:25.010 --> 00:04:28.480
That's it, Marco!
Take him down!

00:04:29.020 --> 00:04:30.960
I won't lose!

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:37.210
Volcano Excellent Emission!

00:04:42.130 --> 00:04:43.320
Okay!

00:04:50.880 --> 00:04:51.940
He did it!

00:04:51.940 --> 00:04:52.930
Magnificent.

00:04:52.930 --> 00:04:54.860
I knew Kai could do it!

00:04:54.860 --> 00:04:57.130
The match is 2-0!

00:04:57.130 --> 00:05:01.380
The Kai/Rei team has won
their ticket to the semi-finals!

00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:05.300
Kai.

00:05:07.460 --> 00:05:08.640
Good.

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:11.100
King and Queen!

00:05:14.490 --> 00:05:16.650
Driger and Dranzer...

00:05:16.650 --> 00:05:18.360
I see. They're nice Beys.

00:05:18.360 --> 00:05:20.620
They'll be ours soon.

00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:23.760
We're leaving, you two.

00:05:29.160 --> 00:05:33.450
You and Max will fight
King and Queen tomorrow.

00:05:33.450 --> 00:05:39.140
I can't begin to imagine what kind
of tricks they'll pull in your battle.

00:05:39.420 --> 00:05:43.720
It's a little late to start
worrying about that now!

00:05:43.720 --> 00:05:45.500
Do you have a plan?

00:05:46.130 --> 00:05:48.440
Sure don't.

00:05:48.980 --> 00:05:52.290
Why don't you try actually
using that brain of yours, Takao?

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:57.720
You couldn't have forgotten what they made Kane,
Yusuf, and many others go through, right?

00:05:57.720 --> 00:06:00.000
I know, I know.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:05.840
If they see parts they want, King and Queen
will do whatever it takes to get them.

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:07.400
If you're not
careful, you'll lose!

00:06:07.400 --> 00:06:09.730
But what are
we supposed to do?

00:06:09.730 --> 00:06:11.820
There's no point
in panicking now.

00:06:11.820 --> 00:06:15.740
We just have to beat
them our own way.

00:06:15.740 --> 00:06:17.300
Right, Kinomiya?

00:06:17.300 --> 00:06:20.740
Yeah! You're right, Kai!

00:06:20.740 --> 00:06:24.200
Now I can't wait
for our battle!

00:06:24.200 --> 00:06:30.130
We'll never lose to those dark
parts hunters, King and Queen!

00:06:30.130 --> 00:06:31.760
That's the spirit, Max!

00:06:32.760 --> 00:06:33.850
Miss Judy!

00:06:33.850 --> 00:06:35.080
Mom!

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:37.500
I brought this for
your match tomorrow.

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:40.820
Here. I upgraded Draciel.

00:06:41.810 --> 00:06:43.560
Draciel V2.

00:06:44.740 --> 00:06:48.560
Its endurance and attack power
have been increased considerably.

00:06:48.560 --> 00:06:51.290
I might even say this is
Draciel's perfected form!

00:06:51.290 --> 00:06:52.780
Mom! Thanks!

00:06:52.780 --> 00:06:54.370
Wow!

00:06:54.370 --> 00:06:56.330
Must be nice...

00:06:56.330 --> 00:06:59.200
What's the matter?
You jealous?

00:06:59.200 --> 00:07:02.490
I mean, like, Max gets
like, all the attention!

00:07:02.490 --> 00:07:05.930
But like, I've been using like, the same thing all the time!

00:07:05.930 --> 00:07:08.610
I've got one for
you too, Takao.

00:07:08.610 --> 00:07:09.760
Kyoujyu!

00:07:09.760 --> 00:07:13.140
I improved the Blade Base
and Weight Disk!

00:07:13.140 --> 00:07:18.880
Rather than calling it a new version,
it's more like Dragoon's ultimate custom!

00:07:19.600 --> 00:07:21.490
Thanks, Kyoujyu!

00:07:22.540 --> 00:07:27.240
I've got nothing to worry about now!
I can take on anything they send my way!

00:07:28.960 --> 00:07:31.800
He sure changed
his tune fast...

00:07:40.020 --> 00:07:41.250
What's that?

00:07:41.250 --> 00:07:45.400
This is the Killer Attack Ring.
I designed it for your match tomorrow.

00:07:45.660 --> 00:07:47.530
Killer Attack Ring?

00:07:47.530 --> 00:07:56.280
Any Beyblade with this can rip
anything it touches to shreds.

00:07:56.280 --> 00:07:57.540
What?

00:07:58.170 --> 00:08:03.720
Your opponents are extraordinary this time.
They'll do whatever it takes to win.

00:08:03.720 --> 00:08:09.090
You won't be able to take the four
Sacred Beasts if you try and play fair!

00:08:09.540 --> 00:08:11.410
Let me see it.

00:08:12.100 --> 00:08:14.470
The Killer Attack Ring...

00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:20.440
This is exactly the kind of thing someone so desperate to win like you would cook up.

00:08:20.440 --> 00:08:22.050
It might be fun!

00:08:22.050 --> 00:08:23.320
What?!

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:30.360
Right? We can use this to shut
Takao's team down for good.

00:08:35.930 --> 00:08:39.160
Time for the final
rounds to begin again!

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:41.820
Let's get on with
the semi-finals!

00:08:41.820 --> 00:08:44.770
Let me introduce the two
teams playing today!

00:08:44.770 --> 00:08:46.940
You know them well!
Last year's champs!

00:08:47.280 --> 00:08:51.560
The Takao Kinomiya/
Max Mizuhara team!

00:08:54.920 --> 00:08:58.340
And their opponents!
Their first showdown!

00:08:58.340 --> 00:09:00.930
The King/Queen team!

00:09:03.370 --> 00:09:06.660
King and Queen are
rising through the ranks...

00:09:06.660 --> 00:09:11.450
If Takao and Max lose to
them before they battle us....

00:09:11.450 --> 00:09:13.490
You don't need to
worry about that.

00:09:13.940 --> 00:09:17.500
They wouldn't go
down so easily.

00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:19.830
I just know it.

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:23.010
Takao! Max!
You can do it!

00:09:23.010 --> 00:09:24.080
Good luck!

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:26.080
Thank you, thank you!

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:29.530
Thanks for all
your support!

00:09:29.530 --> 00:09:31.020
Takao! Over there.

00:09:35.700 --> 00:09:37.660
We're counting
on you, Kinomiya.

00:09:37.660 --> 00:09:39.390
Do it for us.

00:09:39.390 --> 00:09:44.170
Yeah! Those two wanted to
fight in this stadium, too!

00:09:44.170 --> 00:09:46.850
And...
And yet...!

00:09:47.040 --> 00:09:51.040
Max! We have to beat
them, no matter what!

00:09:51.040 --> 00:09:55.600
For all the Bladers who fell
victim to their dirty tricks!

00:09:55.600 --> 00:09:58.440
We're gonna win and
put an end to this!

00:09:58.920 --> 00:10:00.660
We'll see about that.

00:10:02.040 --> 00:10:06.120
The first battle will be
Max Mizuhara VS Queen!

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:08.640
Three! Two! One!

00:10:08.640 --> 00:10:09.970
Go...

00:10:09.970 --> 00:10:11.020
Shoot!

00:10:14.730 --> 00:10:16.560
Go, Draciel!

00:10:17.920 --> 00:10:19.570
Gabriel!!

00:10:20.320 --> 00:10:25.040
Wow! Queen's Grabiel
is dodging Max's attacks!

00:10:25.040 --> 00:10:27.410
She's waiting
for her chance!

00:10:27.410 --> 00:10:30.160
Coward!
Get in there and fight!

00:10:30.160 --> 00:10:34.370
Oh, then let me show you
what I'm really made of.

00:10:34.370 --> 00:10:35.810
What?!

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:38.020
Go, Draciel!

00:10:38.020 --> 00:10:40.120
Max, no! It's a trap!

00:10:40.530 --> 00:10:41.450
What?!

00:10:45.970 --> 00:10:48.720
What's going on?!
Draciel's parts are flying off!

00:10:48.720 --> 00:10:52.060
Here's my analysis!

00:10:52.540 --> 00:10:54.210
This is Gabriel.

00:10:54.210 --> 00:10:56.200
The shape is sort of weird.

00:10:56.360 --> 00:10:59.220
Is that outer area a
part of the Attack Ring?

00:10:59.220 --> 00:11:00.740
I'll pause it.

00:11:01.460 --> 00:11:07.240
She has some sort of object
inserted under her Attack Ring!

00:11:07.240 --> 00:11:08.730
What?!

00:11:09.050 --> 00:11:11.140
Run, Max!
This is dangerous!

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:13.330
Too late!

00:11:13.620 --> 00:11:17.490
Come to mama, Draciel.
I'll grind your Beyblade into scrap.

00:11:17.490 --> 00:11:18.850
What?!

00:11:21.950 --> 00:11:27.540
The Attack Ring Gabriel's equipped with
is designed to extend during rotation!

00:11:32.320 --> 00:11:35.300
This is the power of
my Killer Attack Ring.

00:11:35.300 --> 00:11:37.600
Keep attacking Draciel!

00:11:37.600 --> 00:11:40.300
Cheaters!

00:11:40.440 --> 00:11:44.640
Max, retreat!
Draciel's in danger!

00:11:45.970 --> 00:11:49.090
Darn it...
This is low, Queen!

00:11:50.240 --> 00:11:55.240
So what? I didn't come here to
play some silly sport with you.

00:11:55.240 --> 00:11:57.090
This is a duel
to the death!

00:11:57.090 --> 00:12:00.320
I don't give a damn
about the championships!

00:12:00.900 --> 00:12:04.680
Go, Gabriel!
Destroy Draciel!

00:12:16.800 --> 00:12:20.330
Darn! Genbu!!

00:12:24.420 --> 00:12:27.430
No, fall back!
Your Bey can't take this!

00:12:28.620 --> 00:12:30.370
Max!

00:12:33.520 --> 00:12:38.520
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade 2002"

00:12:38.650 --> 00:12:43.450
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade 2002"

00:12:50.060 --> 00:12:53.320
No... If this keeps
up, Max will lose!

00:12:53.320 --> 00:12:54.570
Max...!

00:12:55.050 --> 00:12:58.850
Max! Are you just
gonna give up?!

00:13:00.570 --> 00:13:05.370
I thought you were going to
avenge all the Bladers they hurt?!

00:13:05.370 --> 00:13:08.700
Everyone here wanted a
spot in that stadium!

00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:13.020
Max, you're here
in their place!

00:13:13.020 --> 00:13:17.680
I'm here...
In place of all of them...

00:13:17.680 --> 00:13:18.660
Max!

00:13:18.660 --> 00:13:19.410
Max...

00:13:19.410 --> 00:13:20.500
Max...!

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:22.200
--Don't lose!
--You can do it!

00:13:22.200 --> 00:13:23.490
Max!

00:13:24.160 --> 00:13:26.930
--Max! Max! Max!

00:13:26.930 --> 00:13:30.500
He's right!
This isn't just my battle!

00:13:30.500 --> 00:13:34.690
I'm fighting for everyone
who couldn't make it!

00:13:34.690 --> 00:13:35.540
--Max! Max! Max!

00:13:35.650 --> 00:13:36.620
This battle...

00:13:36.620 --> 00:13:38.340
Is for them!

00:13:38.340 --> 00:13:39.590
Nonsense!

00:13:39.590 --> 00:13:41.890
Go, Draciel!

00:13:47.300 --> 00:13:50.770
What's gotten into you, Queen?
Finish him off!

00:13:50.770 --> 00:13:52.470
Steal Genbu!

00:13:52.470 --> 00:13:54.220
Gabriel!!

00:14:00.040 --> 00:14:01.680
I refuse to lose...

00:14:08.220 --> 00:14:10.410
What's that sound?

00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:12.360
Kyoujyu, what's that sound?

00:14:12.360 --> 00:14:14.120
I'm processing it!

00:14:14.120 --> 00:14:16.160
Defeat Genbu now!

00:14:21.760 --> 00:14:23.090
What's happening?!

00:14:23.090 --> 00:14:25.970
What did you
do to Gabriel?!

00:14:25.970 --> 00:14:27.340
Doctor!!

00:14:37.860 --> 00:14:39.090
What...

00:14:42.520 --> 00:14:44.000
Gabriel!

00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:46.260
My Gabriel...

00:14:55.420 --> 00:14:58.300
Max Mizuhara wins!

00:15:01.240 --> 00:15:02.490
What happened?

00:15:02.490 --> 00:15:08.040
I think that Attack Ring puts a
considerable amount of strain on the Bey.

00:15:08.040 --> 00:15:12.380
Gabriel couldn't
handle the stress.

00:15:13.010 --> 00:15:16.540
You did it, Max ol' pal!
Good job!

00:15:16.540 --> 00:15:21.040
If I didn't have this upgrade,
I wouldn't have lasted.

00:15:21.040 --> 00:15:22.410
And yet...

00:15:22.410 --> 00:15:24.960
It's all thanks
to your cheers!

00:15:24.960 --> 00:15:26.400
Thank you!

00:15:26.400 --> 00:15:28.280
Thank you all!

00:15:28.690 --> 00:15:33.010
How pathetic. After
pushing Genbu so far...

00:15:33.010 --> 00:15:37.960
King. You have to steal Seiryu,
no matter what the cost!

00:15:40.010 --> 00:15:41.210
Keep it!

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:42.050
What?

00:15:42.050 --> 00:15:44.660
I wouldn't touch that
thing in a million years!

00:15:44.660 --> 00:15:46.560
Stay out of this!

00:15:46.560 --> 00:15:47.800
King!

00:15:47.800 --> 00:15:51.260
I will defeat them myself!

00:15:51.260 --> 00:15:54.450
I'll give you whatever
Sacred Beast power you want!

00:15:54.450 --> 00:15:56.770
You should be
fine with that!

00:15:56.770 --> 00:15:58.220
Kinomiya!

00:15:59.700 --> 00:16:02.330
Uriel doesn't have
any of that junk in it!

00:16:02.330 --> 00:16:06.090
I'll take you down,
fair and square!

00:16:06.090 --> 00:16:09.700
Just how I like it!
Bring it on!

00:16:11.760 --> 00:16:15.450
It's time for
the second battle!

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:16.900
Are you ready?

00:16:17.730 --> 00:16:20.620
Three! Two! One!

00:16:20.620 --> 00:16:22.690
Go...

00:16:22.690 --> 00:16:24.290
Shoot!

00:16:27.480 --> 00:16:30.840
Think you can take me,
Takao Kinomiya?!

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:32.840
Uriel!!

00:16:39.400 --> 00:16:41.810
Bringing out his
Sacred Beast already?

00:16:41.810 --> 00:16:45.900
So you wanna end this quick?
Not on my watch!

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:48.140
Seiryu!!

00:16:59.810 --> 00:17:02.240
Not bad, King!

00:17:02.240 --> 00:17:06.850
Uriel's glad to have a battle with
a half-decent Blader for once!

00:17:06.850 --> 00:17:09.320
Uriel, go!

00:17:18.140 --> 00:17:21.840
Takao's making
King get serious.

00:17:21.840 --> 00:17:25.010
He should be able to
go all out in this battle.

00:17:25.010 --> 00:17:29.500
Now this is what a
semi-final battle is all about!

00:17:29.500 --> 00:17:32.880
They're not giving an inch!

00:17:36.540 --> 00:17:37.880
What?!

00:17:38.900 --> 00:17:40.770
Wait, what?

00:17:40.770 --> 00:17:42.980
Dragoon's acting weird.

00:17:42.980 --> 00:17:46.200
There are strong electromagnetic waves
coming from somewhere in the stadium...

00:17:46.200 --> 00:17:48.090
They're microwaves!

00:17:48.090 --> 00:17:51.940
Someone's aiming at Dragoon
with microwave shots!

00:17:51.940 --> 00:17:53.140
Microwaves?

00:17:53.140 --> 00:17:57.330
You know, like the appliance!
Microwaves are invisible.

00:17:57.330 --> 00:17:59.680
But where
would someone...?

00:17:59.680 --> 00:18:06.850
Just a moment. I'll calculate their position based
on the firing angle, distance, and energy output.

00:18:07.420 --> 00:18:10.340
Up there!
Near the ceiling!

00:18:10.340 --> 00:18:11.730
There!

00:18:13.130 --> 00:18:15.240
Nowhere to run.

00:18:16.600 --> 00:18:17.740
Takao!

00:18:19.730 --> 00:18:21.360
She's...!

00:18:22.120 --> 00:18:25.220
I will obtain Seiryu.
And all the four Sacred Beasts.

00:18:25.220 --> 00:18:28.810
Cut that out!
I'm fighting Dragoon!

00:18:28.810 --> 00:18:30.080
Stay out of this!

00:18:30.080 --> 00:18:33.380
Shut up! I can't rely
on either of you!

00:18:33.380 --> 00:18:37.810
I'll obtain it myself!
Even as an energy mass!

00:18:47.020 --> 00:18:51.020
Darn! We were having
such a good battle, too!

00:18:51.210 --> 00:18:53.370
Let's do this, Kinomiya!

00:18:54.660 --> 00:18:57.900
I want to continue our battle.

00:18:57.900 --> 00:18:58.950
King...

00:19:01.620 --> 00:19:04.480
Okay! It's now or never!

00:19:04.480 --> 00:19:06.770
Lend me your strength!

00:19:07.290 --> 00:19:10.060
Hyper Victory Tornado!

00:19:10.060 --> 00:19:12.500
--Go, Dragoon!
--Go, Uriel!

00:19:23.680 --> 00:19:25.580
Now there's no one
to interrupt us.

00:19:25.580 --> 00:19:28.650
So I can finish you off!

00:19:28.650 --> 00:19:32.600
I like it! I'm gonna hit
you with all I've got!

00:19:32.600 --> 00:19:34.500
Uriel!!

00:19:46.730 --> 00:19:49.790
Dragoon!
Counterattack!

00:19:51.480 --> 00:19:52.710
Uriel...

00:19:52.710 --> 00:19:54.860
Keep pushing!

00:20:13.050 --> 00:20:15.220
What...

00:20:15.220 --> 00:20:19.020
Too bad!
Uriel, Stadium Out!

00:20:19.020 --> 00:20:24.100
The Kinomiya/Mizuhara team
are going to the finals!

00:20:27.050 --> 00:20:28.970
Incredible!

00:20:28.970 --> 00:20:32.600
King and Queen
have been defeated!

00:20:32.600 --> 00:20:34.690
Kane and Jim
have been avenged!

00:20:34.690 --> 00:20:35.730
Yeah.

00:20:40.250 --> 00:20:43.380
This is the end
of your little plot.

00:20:50.930 --> 00:20:52.570
That was fun.

00:20:54.040 --> 00:20:59.200
I'll remember this!
We didn't lose to Dragoon's parts.

00:20:59.200 --> 00:21:03.050
We lost to your power,
Takao Kinomiya.

00:21:03.050 --> 00:21:07.370
Next time I'll beat you
on my own. So get ready!

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:10.020
Sure. We'll be waiting.

00:21:10.020 --> 00:21:11.240
Kinomiya...

00:21:14.400 --> 00:21:16.640
Now it's our turn.

00:21:16.640 --> 00:21:17.410
Yeah.

00:21:20.940 --> 00:21:25.200
Kinomiya.
I will defeat you.

00:22:59.650 --> 00:23:02.280
Takao and Max make
it to the finals!

00:23:02.280 --> 00:23:04.900
But we can't
celebrate just yet.

00:23:04.900 --> 00:23:07.940
Kai and Rei fight
Zeo and Gordo next.

00:23:07.940 --> 00:23:12.290
There's some noise in Zeo's
battle that bothers me.

00:23:12.290 --> 00:23:16.400
What's that, Chairman? If it's too loud, put on some earplugs?

